/T (Multilateral engagement \(WHO\): Post-COVID reforms of global health security rules through the World Health Assembly, focusing on the adoption of targeted amendments to the International Health Regulations \(IHR\) in 2024 and the WHO Pandemic Agreement in 2025. This is a venue where influence operates primarily through text-based negotiation, coalition-building, and institutional design rather than direct operational control.)
